flowchart TD
    A[Poll floor: head check] -->|new work| B[Fetch]
    A -->|nothing to pull/push, clean @| Z[Exit early]
    B --> C[Crash-resume check]
    C --> D[Promote gate]
    D --> E[Fold layers at reconcile point R]
    E --> F[Hold set: unknown categories, class refusals]
    F --> G[Review]
    G --> H{Verdict}
    H -->|pass + canary evidence| I[Apply]
    H -->|blocked| J[Hold + alert by name]
    I --> K[Journal: applied / satisfied]
    K --> L[Publish + peer nudge]
